  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n18 + 48 ÷ 12 × (32 ÷ 4)2 − 8\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5150c5b90ff0d3fbdd6a542cbd6ec09a59c26abaae848bd31e3bf0035c4d0714.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n18 + 48 ÷ 12 × (32 ÷ 4)2 − 8\n\n⇒ 18 + 48 ÷ 12 × 82 − 8\n\n⇒ 18 + 4 × 82 − 8\n\n⇒ 18 + 4 × 64 − 8\n\n⇒ 18 + 256 − 8\n\n⇒ 274 − 8\n\n⇒ 266\n\n**∴ Required answer is 266.**",
